### ========================================================================
### KIEM THU RESTFUL API - HE THONG THU VIEN VA DAT MUON SACH PHAN TAN
### De tai 20 - Mon: Phat trien ung dung phan tan
### Sinh vien: Giang Hong Anh - dtc245200156
### ========================================================================

@api = http://localhost:5000

### 0. Kiem tra trang thai dich vu (Health Check)
GET {{api}}/
Accept: application/json

### ========================================================================
### 1. GET danh sach tat ca cac cuon sach
### Mong doi: 200 OK, mang JSON chua danh sach cac cuon sach
### ========================================================================
GET {{api}}/books
Accept: application/json

### ========================================================================
### 2. GET chi tiet mot cuon sach ton tai (ID = 1)
### Mong doi: 200 OK, JSON BookDto cua cuon sach ID 1
### ========================================================================
GET {{api}}/books/1
Accept: application/json

### ========================================================================
### 3. GET sach khong ton tai (ID = 999)
### Mong doi: 404 Not Found, ApiError "BOOK_NOT_FOUND"
### ========================================================================
GET {{api}}/books/999
Accept: application/json

### ========================================================================
### 4. POST dat muon sach hop le (Book ID = 1) - Theo chuan RESTful
### Mong doi: 201 Created, header Location: /reservations/{guid}, body ReservationDto
### ========================================================================
# @name createReservation
POST {{api}}/books/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "dtc245200156",
  "userName": "Giang Hong Anh"
}

### ========================================================================
### 4b. POST dat muon sach qua /reservations (BookId trong body) - Theo tong quan De tai 20
### Mong doi: 201 Created, header Location: /reservations/{guid}, body ReservationDto
### ========================================================================
POST {{api}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 2,
  "userId": "dtc245200156",
  "userName": "Giang Hong Anh"
}

### ========================================================================
### 5. POST thieu UserId (du lieu khong hop le)
### Mong doi: 400 Bad Request, ApiError "INVALID_RESERVATION"
### ========================================================================
POST {{api}}/books/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "",
  "userName": "Giang Hong Anh"
}

### ========================================================================
### 6. POST dat muon sach khong ton tai (Book ID = 999)
### Mong doi: 404 Not Found, ApiError "BOOK_NOT_FOUND"
### ========================================================================
POST {{api}}/books/999/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "dtc245200156",
  "userName": "Giang Hong Anh"
}

### ========================================================================
### 7. POST dat muon sach het ban kha dung (Book ID = 3, AvailableCopies = 0)
### Mong doi: 400 Bad Request, ApiError "BOOK_UNAVAILABLE"
### ========================================================================
POST {{api}}/books/3/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "dtc245200156",
  "userName": "Giang Hong Anh"
}

### ========================================================================
### 8. GET doc lai Reservation vua tao (dung ID tu request #4 hoac ID mau)
### Mong doi: 200 OK, ReservationDto voi trang thai Pending
### ========================================================================
@reservationId = {{createReservation.response.body.id}}
GET {{api}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Accept: application/json

### 8b. GET doc Reservation khong ton tai
### Mong doi: 404 Not Found, ApiError "RESERVATION_NOT_FOUND"
GET {{api}}/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### ========================================================================
### 9. GET danh sach yeu cau dat muon cua mot nguoi dung
### Mong doi: 200 OK, mang chua cac ReservationDto cua dtc245200156
### ========================================================================
GET {{api}}/users/dtc245200156/reservations
Accept: application/json

### 9b. GET danh sach yeu cau cua nguoi dung chua tung dat muon
### Mong doi: 200 OK, mang rong []
GET {{api}}/users/user_chua_dat_bao_gio/reservations
Accept: application/json
